   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.ai.mil/About/Organization-V2/",
   "text": "The CDAO is shattering bureaucratic inertia by rapidly harnessing advanced private sector AI. We are aggressively adapting these tools for the defense environment, taking calculated risks to deliver iterative, game-changing technology that makes our forces better and faster, today.",
